        salida: caso, texto
            "spec_valida#0", "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cap\",\n      \"type\": \"spec\",\n      \"valid\": true,\n      \"issues\": [],\n      \"durationMs\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": {\n    \"totals\": {\n      \"items\": 1,\n      \"passed\": 1,\n      \"failed\": 0\n    },\n    \"byType\": {\n      \"spec\": {\n        \"items\": 1,\n        \"passed\": 1,\n        \"failed\": 0\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"root\": {\n    \"path\": \"<tmp>\",\n    \"source\": \"nearest\"\n  }\n}\n"
            "cambio_valido#0", "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ch\",\n      \"type\": \"change\",\n      \"valid\": true,\n      \"issues\": [],\n      \"durationMs\": 10\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": {\n    \"totals\": {\n      \"items\": 1,\n      \"passed\": 1,\n      \"failed\": 0\n    },\n    \"byType\": {\n      \"change\": {\n        \"items\": 1,\n        \"passed\": 1,\n        \"failed\": 0\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"root\": {\n    \"path\": \"<tmp>\",\n    \"source\": \"nearest\"\n  }\n}\n"
            "cambio_sin_deltas#0", "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ch\",\n      \"type\": \"change\",\n      \"valid\": false,\n      \"issues\": [\n        {\n          \"level\": \"ERROR\",\n          \"path\": \"file\",\n          \"message\": \"Change must have at least one delta. No deltas found. Ensure your change has a specs/ directory with capability folders (e.g. specs/http-server/spec.md) containing .md files that use delta headers (## ADDED/MODIFIED/REMOVED/RENAMED Requirements) and that each requirement includes at least one \\\"#### Scenario:\\\" block. If this change intentionally modifies no specs (pure refactor, tooling, docs), set \\\"skip_specs: true\\\" in the change's .openspec.yaml instead. Tip: run \\\"openspec change show <change-id> --json --deltas-only\\\" to inspect parsed deltas.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"durationMs\": 8\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": {\n    \"totals\": {\n      \"items\": 1,\n      \"passed\": 0,\n      \"failed\": 1\n    },\n    \"byType\": {\n      \"change\": {\n        \"items\": 1,\n        \"passed\": 0,\n        \"failed\": 1\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"root\": {\n    \"path\": \"<tmp>\",\n    \"source\": \"nearest\"\n  }\n}\n"
            "cambio_sin_deltas#1", "Change 'ch' has issues\n✗ [ERROR] file: Change must have at least one delta. No deltas found. Ensure your change has a specs/ directory with capability folders (e.g. specs/http-server/spec.md) containing .md files that use delta headers (## ADDED/MODIFIED/REMOVED/RENAMED Requirements) and that each requirement includes at least one \"#### Scenario:\" block. If this change intentionally modifies no specs (pure refactor, tooling, docs), set \"skip_specs: true\" in the change's .openspec.yaml instead. Tip: run \"openspec change show <change-id> --json --deltas-only\" to inspect parsed deltas.\nNext steps:\n  - Ensure change has deltas in specs/: use headers ## ADDED/MODIFIED/REMOVED/RENAMED Requirements\n  - Each requirement MUST include at least one #### Scenario: block\n  - Debug parsed deltas: openspec show ch --json --deltas-only\n"
            "spec_sin_purpose#0", "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cap\",\n      \"type\": \"spec\",\n      \"valid\": false,\n      \"issues\": [\n        {\n          \"level\": \"ERROR\",\n          \"path\": \"file\",\n          \"message\": \"Spec must have a Purpose section. Missing required sections. Expected headers: \\\"## Purpose\\\" and \\\"## Requirements\\\". Example:\\n## Purpose\\n[brief purpose]\\n\\n## Requirements\\n### Requirement: Clear requirement statement\\nUsers SHALL ...\\n\\n#### Scenario: Descriptive name\\n- **WHEN** ...\\n- **THEN** ...\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"durationMs\": 0\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": {\n    \"totals\": {\n      \"items\": 1,\n      \"passed\": 0,\n      \"failed\": 1\n    },\n    \"byType\": {\n      \"spec\": {\n        \"items\": 1,\n        \"passed\": 0,\n        \"failed\": 1\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"root\": {\n    \"path\": \"<tmp>\",\n    \"source\": \"nearest\"\n  }\n}\n"
            "requisito_sin_cuerpo#0", "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cap\",\n      \"type\": \"spec\",\n      \"valid\": false,\n      \"issues\": [\n        {\n          \"level\": \"ERROR\",\n          \"path\": \"requirements[0]\",\n          \"message\": \"Requirement \\\"Foo\\\" must contain SHALL or MUST\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"durationMs\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": {\n    \"totals\": {\n      \"items\": 1,\n      \"passed\": 0,\n      \"failed\": 1\n    },\n    \"byType\": {\n      \"spec\": {\n        \"items\": 1,\n        \"passed\": 0,\n        \"failed\": 1\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"root\": {\n    \"path\": \"<tmp>\",\n    \"source\": \"nearest\"\n  }\n}\n"
            "escenarios_en_vinetas#0", "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cap\",\n      \"type\": \"spec\",\n      \"valid\": false,\n      \"issues\": [\n        {\n          \"level\": \"ERROR\",\n          \"path\": \"requirements.0.scenarios\",\n          \"message\": \"Requirement must have at least one scenario\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"level\": \"WARNING\",\n          \"path\": \"requirements[0].scenarios\",\n          \"message\": \"Requirement must have at least one scenario. Scenarios must use level-4 headers. Convert bullet lists into:\\n#### Scenario: Short name\\n- **WHEN** ...\\n- **THEN** ...\\n- **AND** ...\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"durationMs\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": {\n    \"totals\": {\n      \"items\": 1,\n      \"passed\": 0,\n      \"failed\": 1\n    },\n    \"byType\": {\n      \"spec\": {\n        \"items\": 1,\n        \"passed\": 0,\n        \"failed\": 1\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"root\": {\n    \"path\": \"<tmp>\",\n    \"source\": \"nearest\"\n  }\n}\n"
