            "modified_omite_escenario#1", "Change 'ch' has issues\n✗ [ERROR] cap/spec.md: MODIFIED \"Foo\" omits scenario(s) the current spec still has: \"B\". The modified block has 1 scenario; the current spec has 2 scenarios. It adds none. Copy the omitted scenarios into the MODIFIED block (a MODIFIED requirement replaces the whole block, so archive refuses to drop them).\nNext steps:\n  - Ensure change has deltas in specs/: use headers ## ADDED/MODIFIED/REMOVED/RENAMED Requirements\n  - Each requirement MUST include at least one #### Scenario: block\n  - Debug parsed deltas: openspec show ch --json --deltas-only\n"
